WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:11.980
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.840
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.670
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:40.880
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.550
Heavily holding the freedom

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.120
Choosing the invisible path

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.230
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:02.230
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:11.340
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:19.250
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.790
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.760
We wander into the light

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:32.000
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:08.020
Photographic techniques
made rapid progress in this era.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:12.700
Many men rushed to get their portraits taken.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:17.640
Here we go.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:23.650
As if trying to confirm their footsteps
and engrave proof of their existence...

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:26.120
Tamoto Photo Studio

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:25.180
Develop this right away.

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:25.420
Yes, sir.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.890
Kenzo Tamoto

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.380
Would you like another one, Hijikata-sama?

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:31.420
It's enough.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.490
This has left me stiff.

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:37.130
Why don't you have a picture taken
of yourself, too, Tetsunosuke?

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.360
What?

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:41.290
No, I don't deserve that.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:45.040
Don't worry, it's not going to take your soul away.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.970
S-sensei...

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:49.840
Come on, Tetsunosuke. Please.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.310
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.080
So what do you think about this place?

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:01.220
I thank you, Hijikata-san, for sheltering me.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.480
Just keep that to yourself.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:05.890
We're holding you because
you attacked Enomoto.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.220
It's obvious what's going to happen
if you go out there.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:12.190
More importantly, I have something vital
that I want to talk to you about.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:21.010
Akizuki, your objective is neither
Enomoto nor the Republic...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:25.770
but rather the Head of the Conqueror
inside Enomoto. Correct?

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.180
Yes.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:32.310
I want you to entrust me with the objective.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:34.650
Hijikata...

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:46.890
I'm not trying to stop you,
but right now you're a wanted man.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.990
Either way you're stuck.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:54.600
It's the same thing...

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:01.280
That Head is my... No, it's the Republic's enemy!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.180
If I could somehow...

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.890
9th day of the fourth month, Meiji 2, in Otobe

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.890
It is the 9th day of the fourth month,
in the second year of the Meiji Era.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.130
The New Government Army reaches Otobe.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:18.190
Kotetsu (Stonewall)

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.030
They split in three groups and begin the attack.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.770
Have no fear! Forward!

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.770
Army Commander Ryosuke Kuroda

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:29.410
Otobe

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:30.240
They advance towards Hakodate through
Futamataguchi, Kikonai and Matsumae.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:36.780
Along the way they continue to destroy the Republic
Army at those locations with overwhelming forces.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:41.310
Futamataguchi

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:41.310
Goryokaku

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:41.310
Hakodateyama

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:41.310
Kikonai

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:41.310
Matsumae

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:41.310
All except Futamataguchi.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:45.750
13th day of the fourth month, Meiji 2, at Futamataguchi

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:53.930
Despite the tactical disadvantage
faced by Hijikata's Republic Army,

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.230
they manage to evade the New Government Army.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.800
Tetsunosuke.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.110
Yes!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.680
The next time the gunfire calms down
we're going to charge.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:04.440
Yes!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.970
If we make it back safely
I'll show you how to drink.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.770
Yes! I'd love that!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.420
All men follow me!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:18.020
They're charging us!

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:18.850
That's Hijikata!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:28.300
This is now known as Hijikata's
Invincible Charge at Futamataguchi.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:43.610
Hijikata's victory here inspired many.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:51.690
Our beautiful nation that we love.

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:56.680
We shall protect it with our own hands
and destroy all the tainted enemies!

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.620
Destroy them...

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:01.230
Destroy them no matter what!

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:03.630
We must destroy them no matter what!

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:07.070
We shall protect our beautiful nation
with our own hands!

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:10.940
We shall protect our beautiful nation
with our own hands!

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:11.540
Destroy them no matter what!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.070
This is getting strange...
Destroy them no matter what!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.940
She's scaring me...

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.950
This could mean that there's no boundary
between dream and reality,

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:24.050
between the stage play and the truth for her...

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:36.470
This is Tateaki Enomoto,
the president of the Republic.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.730
Thank you for coming today.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:44.770
Don't you think you took too long
to bring him this tribute?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.710
We're well aware of that, and apologize...

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:50.280
We all have businesses to run...

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.870
Please forgive us.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.710
Businesses, you said?

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:57.310
You could pay us later if you like.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.890
Do you mean to charge us?!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:08.430
Unbelievable! Those merchants dare to
try and make money off of us samurai?

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.500
Unforgivable!

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.730
We need to cut them down!

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:11.770
Wait!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:17.080
I understand how you feel, but our
poor financial situation is also a reality.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:17.840
We should just...

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:19.270
No, we should kill them!

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.750
But, Otori-dono, the President is...

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.380
He hasn't said anything.

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:36.450
That's why we need to be considerate
and stand up for him!

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.990
We are comrades! For the Republic!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.340
For the Republic, we must kill them!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:53.680
Kill them!

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:05.910
I'll do anything you want me to do,
so please spare my life!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.660
This should set an example to the others.
Kill them all!

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.590
Money... If you want money...

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.530
Hurry up! Take all the money!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:24.000
Listen! I don't care even if they're women
or children, show them no mercy!

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:33.480
Kid, curse the fact that
you were born into this family!

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:35.150
Die!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.420
You're...

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.520
Die!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:51.870
He's unbelievably strong!

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.000
That's...

00:08:57.740 --> 00:08:59.000
Akizuki-sama!

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:00.840
Akizuki-sama!

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.650
Zagashira!

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:07.010
Akizuki-sama, what are you doing here?

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:09.550
Zagashira, please take this kid.

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:11.420
Who are those guys?

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:12.910
Enomoto's men.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:15.790
Akizuki-sama!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:25.690
This is just like... just like
what happened 10 years ago.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:39.740
This is uncalled-for... So uncalled-for...

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:47.020
The Republic Army has gone that far already...

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:53.460
Actually I'm very concerned. Everyone
seems to be caught up in this fever.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.260
I agree...

00:09:55.800 --> 00:10:00.200
It looks more like they want to start a war
rather than protect this country.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:06.500
And the one instigating this is none other than...

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:17.710
What happened to you, Leader?!

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:33.260
Take a look at this!

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:40.130
At a time when the Republic must stand together,
these fools are too busy counting money!

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:44.220
They are the very enemies
of my beloved Republic!

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.110
They are traitors!

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.310
That's right! They're the enemies!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:50.620
Traitors!

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:56.460
Who goes there?

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.660
Hijikata-dono!

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:07.560
What... What have you done?!

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:09.970
This is what the President wants!

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.670
In other words, it's the Republic's will!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:16.480
We didn't found the Republic to do stuff like this!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.550
Then what for?

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:21.580
You just wanted a place to die, Hijikata!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:25.690
You can't found a country on platitudes!

00:11:25.690 --> 00:11:28.160
Someone has to do the unpleasant work!

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.260
Time is running out...

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.170
I must do something about it!

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.140
Come forth!

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:53.410
Show yourself!

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:56.980
Head of the Conqueror,
inside my comrade Enomoto!

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:00.050
I, Hijikata, will destroy you!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.540
Why you...

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:33.820
My Izumi no Kami Kanesada and I
aren't enough to kill you?!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.120
Head of the Conqueror!

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:58.050
Enomoto-san!

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:59.880
It's me, Hijikata!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.350
Enomoto-san!

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:02.610
That's quite enough.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.690
What are you doing? Get out of here!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:11.720
No, you need to leave this room.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:12.590
What?

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.270
Stop it.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.940
You're dismissed, Hijikata.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:41.990
What? You want me to leave the squad?

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:48.030
That's right. I want you to pick up the photograph
and the letter Tamoto is keeping for me

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:50.330
and take them to my brother-in-law in Hino.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.260
What?

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:54.170
And take this, too.

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.170
<i>TO KAISHU KATSU</i>

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:58.600
I want you to try to deliver this to Katsu-sensei,
who's been placed in confinement in Sunpu.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.570
B-but I!

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:05.180
Listen. Make sure to give this directly to him.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:11.460
At this time Hijikata has already
realized the fate of the Republic

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:22.330
and his made up his mind to use Katsu
to tell Saigo the truth about the Republic.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.870
"Enough blood had been shed", he wrote.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:33.140
"My intention is to die here, but please be merciful
to the young people, who carry the future of Japan."

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:35.010
Sensei, I'll come with you, too!

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:40.510
I want you to live.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:43.820
Tetsunosuke...

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:57.830
I can't tell you the reason, but I'll leave
Hakodate. That's all I can tell you.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.300
Please take care!

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:14.740
Come on. Let's go. Enomoto is expecting you.

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:27.030
That's the picture Hijikata-sama left with me.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:31.990
Pull yourself together!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:36.340
If you understand what Hijikata-sama
is prepared to do,

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:38.400
you should follow through with your duty for him!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:44.280
Isn't that how you should repay him?

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:52.250
11th day of the fifth month, Meiji 2, at Benten Misaki Daiba

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.250
It is the 11th day of the fifth month... the fateful day...

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:56.250
All cannons, fire!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.300
Don't panic! Return fire!

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:03.660
Fire!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.360
The third and fifth cannon platforms exploded!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:08.300
What happened?

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:10.270
We did it!

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:12.580
We, the Yuguntai, have carried out our mission!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.310
All right! Let's go in there!

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.980
Koban
Hachiman
Taishin
<i>YUGUNTAI</i>

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:24.810
Ibaragi, what are you doing?

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:27.250
The enemy's assault has started!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.390
Where's the president?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:30.830
Please be quiet.

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:34.590
The President is about to raise the curtain...

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.790
The final curtain.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:44.300
Once located near the sea and constructed
with an unfortified design without walls,

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:47.400
Goryokaku was hardly a secure fortress.

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:53.710
It has now been reborn as an iron-walled stronghold.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.570
Hijikata-sama, what was that noise?

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:25.300
Just worry about getting to our men at the
Benten artillery battery right now! Stay focused!

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.870
Ippongi Gate

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.390
Now! Charge!

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:32.940
Is this the work of Sotetsu Ibaragi?

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.340
This is my destiny.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.050
Hijikata!

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:33.970
The Head... Destroy the
Head of the Conqueror, Akizuki...

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.750
Soji...

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:49.420
Commander... Kondo...

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:51.680
Now I can join y-

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.530
Hijikata-sensei...

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.870
I will carry out my mission no matter what!

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:13.570
Even if it's in exchange for my own life!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.190
Let's settle the score.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.860
I've been waiting for this.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>IROHANIHOHETO</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:47.760
EPISODE 25
GORYOKAKU
EMERGES

00:23:34.020 --> 00:23:36.690
Now it's clear who my enemy is.

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:39.420
It is time for me to carry out my mission
as the Eternal Assassin.

00:23:39.560 --> 00:23:43.560
My comrades, show them
the power of the Republic!

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:46.400
I'm free, embraced by her tenderness!

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:49.030
I can die in order to protect her!

00:23:47.760 --> 00:24:02.540
GORYOKAKU
<i>EMERGES</i>

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:53.900
Don't stop moving forward!
Victory! Victory for the Republic!

00:23:53.900 --> 00:24:00.640
If I ever see her again, I promise
I'll kill her with one stroke with my sword.
